<script setup lang="ts">
import {number,price,time} from '../format'
import {lifecycleState,lifecycleCheck,exitReason,type Lifecycle} from '../quantLifecycle'
defineProps<{value:Lifecycle}>()
</script>
<template><section class="lifecycle"><h4>完整交易核对 · {{lifecycleState(value.status)}}</h4>
<p v-if="value.status==='Inconsistent'" role="alert" class="radar-notice">存在未通过的账目检查，请展开下方核验项。最终净额暂不确认。</p>
<p>原始数量 {{number(value.initialQuantity,8)}} = 已退出 {{number(value.exitedQuantity,8)}} + 剩余 {{number(value.remainingQuantity,8)}}。累计结算净额 {{number(value.realizedNet,6)}} U（含迟到资金费调整）。</p>
<p v-if="value.finalNet!=null">最终净额 <strong>{{number(value.finalNet,6)}} U</strong>；平仓 {{time(value.closedAt)}}。账目核对通过仅说明保存的资料一致，不代表策略盈利或真实撮合。</p>
<p v-else>最终净额待确认：{{lifecycleState(value.status)}}。未平仓浮盈亏不算最终收益。</p>
<p v-if="value.remainingQuantity>0">当前止损 {{price(value.currentStop)}}；持仓到期 {{time(value.holdUntil)}}；退出状态：{{exitReason(value.pendingExit)}}<template v-if="value.exitAfter">，触发来源 {{time(value.exitAfter)}}</template>。触发后仍须后续有效盘口才能模拟退出。</p>
<p>原开仓费 {{number(value.entryFee,6)}} U；累计退出费 {{number(value.exitFees,6)}} U。来源资金费 {{number(value.observedFunding,6)}} = 已结算分摊 {{number(value.settledFunding,6)}} + 剩余分摊 {{number(value.openFunding,6)}} + 迟到调整 {{number(value.lateFundingAdjustment,6)}} U（正付负收）。</p>
<p>资金费 {{value.fundingStatus}}，已知至 {{time(value.fundingKnownThrough)}}。仍持仓时最近10分钟费用暂记；平仓后须覆盖至最终退出再确认净额。</p>
<details><summary>数量、费用与退出证据 · {{value.checks.length}}项检查</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>检查项</th><th>状态</th><th>应有 / 实际</th><th>依据</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="c in value.checks" :key="c.key"><td>{{c.name}}</td><td>{{lifecycleCheck(c.status)}}</td><td>{{c.expected==null?'—':number(c.expected,8)}} / {{c.actual==null?'—':number(c.actual,8)}}</td><td>{{c.reason}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>
<details v-if="value.legs.length"><summary>逐笔退出明细 · {{value.legs.length}}条</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>时间 / 原因</th><th>数量 / 退出价</th><th>毛额 / 净额 U</th><th>分摊开仓费 / 退出费 / 资金费 U</th><th>触发后界限 / 盘口来源与接收</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="leg in value.legs" :key="leg.tradeId"><td>{{time(leg.closedAt)}}<small>{{leg.reason}} · {{leg.finalExit?'最终退出':'分批退出'}}</small></td><td>{{number(leg.quantity,8)}}<small>{{price(leg.exitPrice)}}</small></td><td>{{number(leg.grossPnl,6)}} / {{number(leg.netPnl,6)}}</td><td>{{number(leg.entryFee,6)}} / {{number(leg.exitFee,6)}} / {{number(leg.fundingCost,6)}}</td><td>{{time(leg.triggerAfter)}}<small>{{time(leg.bookAt)}} / {{time(leg.bookReceivedAt)}}</small></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>逐腿净额已含分摊开仓费、退出费与当时已入账资金费；迟到调整单独列在上方，不重复扣费。</p></details>
<p v-else>暂无退出腿，数量和成本核对不代表退出链路已被现场验证。</p>
<details v-if="value.legs.some(l=>l.timing)" class="exit-timing"><summary>退出时序与等待</summary><section v-for="leg in value.legs.filter(l=>l.timing)" :key="leg.tradeId"><p>{{time(leg.closedAt)}} · {{leg.reason}}。{{leg.timing!.status==='HistoricalPartial'?'旧交易缺少本轮判定时间，保留部分资料':leg.timing!.status==='Invalid'?'本机时间检查未通过，耗时待核对':'已记录触发时序'}}。</p><p v-if="leg.timing!.observation">来源 {{time(leg.timing!.observation.sourceAt)}} → 本机接收 {{time(leg.timing!.observation.receivedAt)}} → 引擎判定 {{time(leg.timing!.observation.observedAt)}}；触发价 {{price(leg.timing!.observation.triggerPrice)}} / 当时止损 {{price(leg.timing!.observation.stopAtObservation)}}。</p><p>盘口接收 {{time(leg.timing!.bookReceivedAt)}}；结算计算 {{time(leg.timing!.computedAt)}}（账本成交时间仍采用原轮次资料时点）。</p><p>本机接收→判定 {{number(leg.timing!.receiveToObservationMs,1)}} ms；判定→结算计算 {{number(leg.timing!.observationToComputationMs,1)}} ms；盘口接收→结算计算 {{number(leg.timing!.bookReceiveToComputationMs,1)}} ms。{{leg.timing!.bookCachedAtObservation==null?'':leg.timing!.bookCachedAtObservation?'判定时盘口已在缓存。':'判定后收到退出盘口。'}}</p><small>{{leg.timing!.meaning}}</small></section></details>
<small>{{value.version}} · 核对时点 {{time(value.asOf)}} · 只读账本，不补造或重结算原记录。</small></section></template>
